      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvCheckpointExtensions",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvCheckpointExtensions.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Syntactic sugar for the resumable-extraction pattern: atomically persist and read back a\nrecord counter, and resume a <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvExtractor%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> from it via\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvExtractor%601.SkipRecordCount\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>.</p>\n"
    },
