      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvColumnAttribute",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvColumnAttribute.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Configures how a property is mapped to a CSV column when read or written.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvColumnMap.yml",
