        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminator<TBase>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminator-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Describes how a single CSV file mixes multiple record shapes, keyed by a discriminator column, so a\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvExtractor%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> binds each row to the right concrete type and a\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvLoader%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> writes each record's type and columns. Build one with\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminatorBuilder%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> — that path is trim/AOT-safe. Constructing it directly\nfrom a <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminator%601.Mapping\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> dictionary is supported but reflects over the mapped types at run time.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminatorAction.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminatorAction.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminatorAction",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminatorAction.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">How a polymorphic <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvExtractor%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> (read) or <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvLoader%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>\n(write) handles a row whose discriminator value — or, on write, whose runtime type — is not in\nthe <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminator%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> mapping.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminatorBuilder-1.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminatorBuilder-1.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminatorBuilder<TBase>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminatorBuilder-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Fluent, trim/AOT-safe builder for a <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminator%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>. Each\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvDiscriminatorBuilder%601.Map%60%601(System.String%2cSystem.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyList%7bWolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvColumnMap%7d)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> call names a concrete type generically,\nso the mapping and its per-type <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvColumnMap\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>s are resolved with the property metadata\ntrimming/AOT needs preserved.</p>\n"
    },
