      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidationException",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidationException.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Thrown when a record fails validation and <code>OnValidationFailure</code> is\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidationFailureAction.Stop\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>. Carries the source line and the aggregated\nfailure reasons.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidationFailureAction.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidationFailureAction.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidationFailureAction",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidationFailureAction.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Chooses what a <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvExtractor%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> (or <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvLoader%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>) does with a\nrecord that fails one or more <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidator%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>s. In every case the invalid record is\ncounted (<code>CurrentInvalidItemCount</code>) and the <code>InvalidRecordHandler</code>, if any, is invoked first.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidationResult.yml",
