      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidator<T>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidator-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">A synchronous, per-record validation rule. Runs after a record is bound and returns a\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidationResult\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>. Combine several on the extractor's (or loader's) <code>Validators</code>\ncollection; their failures aggregate.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidator.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidator.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidator",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Factory methods for the common built-in <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.CsvValidator%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> rules. Each takes a selector\nthat reads the member under test, so the rules stay strongly typed without reflection.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.Csv.EtlPipelineCsvExtensions.yml",
      "output": {
